# electron-vite bundles electron.vite.config.ts to a timestamped .mjs HERE, in
# the repo root, and imports that. It is deleted when the build finishes, but
# it exists for long enough to show up in `git status` mid-build (and, before
# this line, to make the config's own commit stamp report every build dirty).
electron.vite.config.*.mjs
